      "id": 18,
      "options": {
        "content": "### AI Maintenance Summary & Decision Support\n\nAI Maintenance Summary is powered by the **Grafana LLM Plugin** (`grafana-llm-app`) connected to curated PostgreSQL views (`v_plant_uptime`, `v_line_uptime`, `v_downtime_by_asset`, `v_repeat_failures`, `v_open_rca_actions`, `v_shared_asset_risk`, `v_condition_measurements`).\n\n#### Key Operational Questions Supported in Interview:\n- **Plant Uptime Performance**: *\"What is keeping plant uptime below target?\"* → Line 2 downtime (85.95% uptime) driven by Filler-201 and Conveyor-201 repeat issues.\n- **Line Comparison**: *\"Why is Line 2 worse than Line 1?\"* → Line 1 achieved 97.61% in August vs. Line 2 at 92.71% due to packaging and conveying failures.\n- **Reliability Engineering**: *\"What changed after the Filler-201 RCA?\"* → Root cause identified bracket vibration; PM Revision 2 added explicit locking hardware and security checks; repeat failures dropped from 11/mo to 5/mo.\n- **Predictive Intervention**: *\"Why is Air-Comp-001 a predictive maintenance concern?\"* → Simultaneous dependency on Line 1 & Line 2; vibration trended from 1.63 to 3.13 mm/s, prompting planned intervention during sanitation window.\n\n*Run `.\\scripts\\test-ai-summary.ps1` to execute live grounded queries against OpenAI BASE (`gpt-4o-mini`) and LARGE (`gpt-4o`) models.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "AI Maintenance Summary",
      "type": "text"
    }
